
~ start

match get_choice_count("bottom_drawer")
	when 0
		PLUM: I wonder what's inside. (thinking)

	else
		You are not opening it again...

- Open the top drawer
	PLUM: These clothes are all so neatly folded! (happy)
	PLUM: They look my size.
	=> END

- Open the bottom drawer
	match get_choice_count("bottom_drawer")
		when 0
			$> increment_choice("bottom_drawer")
			PLUM: Dad...? (scared)
			VINCENT: Hey! Don't. (worried)
			PLUM: I didn't expect it to... (Crying)
			VINCENT: It's not your fault... Be careful where you're looking okay. (worried)
			PLUM: I want to leave... (crying)
			VINCENT: We'll leave soon...
			=> END

		else
			=> start

- Leave it alone
	=> END
